[TITLE]
WaterFiberSim - test network: reservoir R1, supply main P0, 3x3 grid (100 m pipes)
Demands at J13, J31, J33 (4 L/s each). Pipes sized so that at peak demand velocity is ~0.5-0.9 m/s in the
main pipes and head loss <= 10 m/km everywhere (design criteria: see docs/fonti.md). Coordinates in metres.

